WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.665
The three option cards introduce routes for exploration One

00:00:04.731 --> 00:00:10.059
asks operations to handle the delivery-sequence discussion Another asks

00:00:10.072 --> 00:00:14.205
for a later executive slot Each has conditions

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:19.507
The business decision protective input and control-room acceptance are

00:00:19.613 --> 00:00:23.718
separate boxes A preferred option is not ready until

00:00:23.757 --> 00:00:25.981
the relevant owners confirm their parts

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:29.715
A physical lunch is not merely a renamed virtual

00:00:29.781 --> 00:00:35.570
call Location travel protection and monitoring scope may change

00:00:36.492 --> 00:00:39.531
Check those conditions before making any promise
